# Ctrl+C clears input (with the "Press Ctrl-C again to exit" hint,
# internal/tui/keys.go Router's ctrl+c case), then a second Ctrl+C within
# the DoublePress window exits the program.
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@smoke
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE this will be cleared
SHOT before-ctrl-c
EXPECT /this will be cleared/
KEY ctrl+c
# The hint lasts DoublePress (1s, internal/tui/keys.go); a real-terminal
# SHOT can take that long, so catch it before the screenshot.
WAITFOR /Press Ctrl-C again to exit/ 1
SHOT after-first-ctrl-c
EXPECT_NOT /this will be cleared/
KEY ctrl+c
WAIT 1
NOTE second Ctrl+C should have exited kiln; the driver's teardown will not need its own ctrl+c
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
